    "description": {
      "en": "The higher (maximum) level of the basic PIT allowance, 8,964 EUR/year (since 2005-01-01, with 4 historical values), granted to lower-income taxpayers before any income-based withdrawal applies, per its label. It is used in tin_admn_lt (BenCalc, parameter comp_perTU, post-2022 formula) and in tin_lt (BenCalc, parameter comp_perTU, 'Since 2009: basic allowance for the final tax liability'), representing the maximum annual tax-free amount under Lithuania's basic allowance regime. Not covered by the benefits theme document; description based on the constant's label and its two usage-site comments."
